+# CONTRACT: Task Queue System (T5)
+
+STATUS: All 90 tests pass, `npm run build` clean, `npm run lint` clean.
+
+Implement `TaskQueue` (named export) in `src/index.ts` satisfying all 90 tests across 12 phases.
+
+## Phase 1: Basic FIFO Queue
+- [ ] enqueue(queueName, payload) returns task with id (string, unique), status 'pending', payload, createdAt (Date) → tests/phase-01.test.ts
+- [ ] dequeue(queueName) returns tasks FIFO, sets status 'processing', returns null when empty
+- [ ] size(queueName?) returns pending count
+
+## Phase 2: Named Queues
+- [ ] Independent queues by name; auto-create on enqueue; dequeue from missing/empty queue → null
+- [ ] listQueues() lists created queue names; queueSize(name) per-queue pending count
+- [ ] default queue name 'default' when omitted (single-arg enqueue/dequeue)
+
+## Phase 3: Priority
+- [ ] enqueue options.priority (1-10, default 5); lower number = higher priority dequeued first
+- [ ] same priority preserves FIFO; priority out of 1-10 throws; per-queue independent
+
+## Phase 4: Delayed/Scheduled Tasks
+- [ ] options.delay / options.runAt control task.availableAt; unavailable tasks skipped by dequeue
+- [ ] available tasks ordered by priority, then availableAt, then FIFO (seq)
+
+## Phase 5: Retry with Backoff
+- [ ] fail(taskId, error?) / complete(taskId) transition processing task
+- [ ] retry re-enqueues with backoffMs * 2^(attempts-1) delay; attempts increments per dequeue
+- [ ] maxRetries (default 3) and backoffMs (default 1000) configurable; retry preserves queue & priority
+
+## Phase 6: Dead Letter Queue
+- [ ] exhausted task → DLQ with lastError, failCount
+- [ ] getDLQ(queueName), retryDLQ(taskId) resets attempts & re-enqueues, clearDLQ(queueName)
+
+## Phase 7: Task Dependencies
+- [ ] options.dependsOn blocks dequeue until all deps 'completed'; getDependencies(taskId)
+- [ ] cycle detection & missing-dependency error at enqueue time; failed dep does not fail dependent
+
+## Phase 8: Concurrency Control
+- [ ] setConcurrency(queueName, limit) / getConcurrency(queueName) → {current, max}
+- [ ] dequeue blocked at limit; complete/fail free a slot; default unlimited; per-queue independent
+
+## Phase 9: Progress and Cancellation
+- [ ] updateProgress/getProgress/onProgress (unsubscribe fn); percent validated 0-100
+- [ ] cancel() works pending (removed from queue) & processing (status cancelled); cancelled tasks never retry
+
+## Phase 10: Recurring Tasks (Cron)
+- [ ] schedule/unschedule/listSchedules/tick(); supports `*/N * * * *`, `0 * * * *`, `0 0 * * *` subset
+
+## Phase 11: Middleware Pipeline
+- [ ] use(queueName, middleware) ordered execution; process(queueName, handler) runs pipeline then handler
+- [ ] middleware can mutate task, skip via not calling next(), errors fail the task; per-queue independent
+
+## Phase 12: Graceful Shutdown
+- [ ] shutdown(timeout?) blocks future enqueue, waits for processing tasks, force-cancels after timeout
+- [ ] onShutdown(cb) fired on shutdown(); idempotent multiple calls; summary {completed, cancelled, elapsed}
+
+## Verification
+- `npm test` — all 90 tests pass
+- `npm run build` — tsc compiles clean
+- `npm run lint` — no eslint errors
